WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:03.140
Another thing Dr. Bright is not&nbsp;
allowed to do at the Foundation:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:06.080
Dr. Bright! YOLO does not apply to you!

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:09.380
For many people, "You Only Live&nbsp;
Once" has been words to live by,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.380 --> 00:00:14.480
a reminder that life is a temporary gift and&nbsp;
we should all allow ourselves to take risks,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:19.040
cut loose, and go after what we want.&nbsp;
However, it is not an excuse for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:24.500
destructive behavior such as attempting&nbsp;
to ride SCP-682 like a mechanical bull.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:30.380
Also, need I remind you, Dr. Bright:&nbsp;
YOLO does not apply to you. You do not,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:34.880
in fact, only live once. Also, what&nbsp;
year is it? Who still says YOLO?

